msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:10
#: a3a2f8cc9e8040ffb8c101da529080b4
msgid "`SmartAP PDB <https://sky-drones.com/power/smartap-pdb.html>`__ (Power Distribution Board) is a board which allows transferring the power from the battery to ESCs / Motors and generate power supply for the autopilot and other peripherals with different voltage levels. Also, PDB provides the functionality for battery voltage / current measurements. SmartAP PDB makes high-power lines connections easier and much more reliable."
msgstr ""

